{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "...Because it's dangerous.": "",
  "Forget it. I'm going home.": "",
  "(Is he hiding in such dangerous places to get his dad's attention?)": "",
  "(Well, at least the job's done. I'll get in touch with Ohata-san.)": "",
  "Yagami-san, I trust that you found Ayumu?": "",
  "Fantastic, thank you! I'll send you the money digitally again.": "",
  "Um, Ohata-san. About your son...": "",
  "Sorry, sorry, late for a meeting! Thank you so much, though!": "",
  "J-Just a sec—": "",
  "(...He hung up. He's too preoccupied to ask about his son.)": "",
  "(I wonder if he even pays attention to him when they're together...)": "",
  "(That poor kid...)": "",
  "Hey, isn't that the boy from before?": "",
  "Um. Excuse me. I'm looking for a boy, about 6 years old...": "",
  "Yeah, I saw him. He was strolling toward the Hills Garden.": "",
  "Toward the Hills Garden. Got it, thank you!": "",
  "Hey, aren't you his father? You really oughta keep an eye on that boy.": "",
  "(I'm not his father...)": "",
  "Yagami-san, I apologize for the constant stream of requests.": "",
  "No worries, it keeps me busy. Ayumu-kun is hiding again?": "",
  "Yes, and I have a contract to settle with a client of ours.": "",
  "Ohata-san, like I said before, Ayumu-kun is doing this in hopes that you'll be the one who finds him...": "",
  "I know that, but it's not like I can just put my job on hold to do that!": "",
  "I can't pretend to know all your circumstances, but I think you need to set aside some time for your son...": "",
  "I will, I will! As soon as I get this contract locked!": "",
  "If you'll just do this, I'll give you 120,000! That's worth your time, right?": "",
  "Fine, but I'm only taking this case on one condition...": "",
  "After this job's done, you make some time for Ayumu-kun.": "",
  "I will! And thank you!": "",
  "I'll send you the photo Ayumu sent me as usual, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Keep an eye out for him!": "",
  "(I can't help but wonder if he's going to keep his promise...)": "",
  "Yagami-san, this is the photo Ayumu sent me. Find him, please!": "",
  "(Huh, he doesn't seem to be somewhere high this time. It looks like this was taken indoors?)": "",
  "(I can tell there's a Wild Jackson outside the window, though. That should narrow it down.)": "",
  "(Judging from the photo Ayumu-kun sent, he must be in one of these buildings.)": "",
  "(Whew, cleaned that up. Ayumu-kun sure chose a rough spot this time.)": "",
  "Ayumu-kun, are you in here? I give up, so you can come out now!": "",
  "...I'm here, mister.": "",
  "Oh, so you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>are</font_kind> here. This isn't safe, so let's get outside.": "",
  "Ayumu-kun, this place is where a lot of scary guys hang out. Don't ever come back here, okay?": "",
  "...Dad isn't coming again?": "",
  "Sorry, buddy. He's busy again.": "",
  "Ayumu!": "",
  "...Huh? D-Dad?": "",
  "Ohata-san? I thought you had work to do?": "",
  "It hit me when I really looked at the picture Ayumu sent me...": "",
  "Isn't this an office for... Well, you know, right?": "",
  "Once I realized it, I put work aside and came straight down.": "",
  "Ayumu! You're not hurt, are you?": "",
  "You came to find me even though you knew it'd be dangerous, Dad?": "",
  "Of course, son. I would never want you to get hurt.": "",
  "Not that I had a plan or anything as I dashed out of the office... Haha.": "",
  "That's okay, Dad.": "",
  "Hey, you hungry, Ayumu? Why don't we grab something to eat? Anything you want!": "",
  "I want omurice.": "",
  "All right, let's hit the town! I'll get you some real good omelet rice!": "",
  "Yagami-san, thank you so much. Here's your pay for today.": "",
  "And don't worry. I know I screwed up. But I'm gonna make it right.": "",
  "Ayumu means more to me than anything, and I'll show him that.": "",
  "Yeah, I think that's all he wants.": "",
  "Well, ready, Ayumu?": "",
  "(...I'm happy for you, buddy.)": "",
  "...What company is this? Hm?": "",
  "Huh, what the hell are you doing!? This some kinda raid!?": "",
  "(Oh crap... It's a yakuza front, isn't it?)": "",
  "(Don't tell me this is what he meant by going somewhere dangerous!)": "",
  "A kid!? Ain't no kids around here!": "",
  "(...I don't have much choice. If I explain the situation, maybe they'll listen to reason.)": "",
  "You sonuvabitch... You a cop!?": "",
  "You think I'm gonna let you raid us on some flimsy bullshit like that!?": "",
  "Umm, excuse me?": "",
  "You asshole... Go play your baby games somewhere else. This place is off-limits.": "",
  "If you want in so bad, you'll have to go through me!": "",
  "A raid? Ha ha, no, sir. Actually...": "",
  "I'm looking for a child, and I'm pretty sure he's hiding in your building.": "",
  "Usually I'd agree with you, but this kid's really good at hiding...": "",
  "It's just a game of hide-and-seek, sir, please...": "",
  "Oh, was that boy lost again?": "",
  "A shame his parents let this happen.": "",
  "Excuse me... I'm looking for a boy myself, about six years old?": "",
  "Yes, I saw him walking down East Taihei Boulevard.": "",
  "Are you his father? You really ought to keep a better eye on him.": "",
  "Uh, no, but... Thanks.": "",
  "(East Taihei Boulevard, huh? Guess I'll have a look.)": "",
  "Pardon me, sir, but could I get a minute of your time?": "",
  "What can I do for you?": "",
  "Well, my name is Mami Sakuma, and I've been working here for a while now.": "",
  "Basically, I'm looking for customer feedback. Would you mind describing how that tasted just now?": "",
  "Sure. I tend not to hold back, though.": "",
  "That's fine! I've been training to make each pastry exactly like the owner does, so I need all the constructive criticism I can get.": "",
  "Wow. Sounds like you're working hard.": "",
  "Heh, I try!": "",
  "But it's all a part of following my dream, so I don't mind. Because one day, I'll be the best patissier in town!": "",
  "It's nice to be passionate about your job, isn't it?": "",
  "Of course! So, would you mind sharing your thoughts? On the road to perfecting confections, every comment counts!": "",
  "Great, thank you so much!": "",
  "Now, can I ask what you thought of that cake?": "",
  "Yeah, so I thought the chocolate cake was a little too sweet.": "",
  "I say that because most of your menu is sweet stuff. Some people might wanna order something more on the bitter side.": "",
  "That makes sense... We do have a lot of different people coming through here, after all.": "",
  "Yeah. And besides, wouldn't a bitter cake pair better with one of your beverages? At least I think so.": "",
  "Wow, that was actually pretty insightful! Thank you!": "",
  "It might just be me, but I think the cheesecake's a little lacking in the sour department.": "",
  "You mean it's not sour enough?": "",
  "Well, if I were a customer who wanted something sweet, I'd probably pick something else. Almost anything can be sweet.": "",
  "But the thing that makes a cheesecake a cheesecake is that unmistakable tanginess that lingers on the tongue.": "",
  "That's true.": "",
  "So I think you should keep sourness in mind when making your next batch.": "",
  "Is this cake another original of yours, Sakuma-san?": "",
  "It sure is. How'd you like it?": "",
  "Hmm, it was pretty good... But it almost felt like it was missing something.": "",
  "It kinda just tasted like a normal cake, you know? It needs that special something to make it really stand out.": "",
  "I'll remember that, thank you. That's not a bad idea.": "",
  "So, the seasonal cake is good. It's got fresh fruit, it's got fresh flavor. But...": "",
  "I feel like the cake itself is losing out because of the generic name. Give it some flair.": "",
  "I see... Now that you bring it up, it does sound a bit dull.": "",
  "Just a bit. When it comes to marketing a product, naming it something memorable is one of the most important parts.": "",
  "I'll remember that, thank you. That was actually quite insightful!": "",
  "Well, it's just my personal opinion, so take it with a grain of salt.": "",
  "Oh, not at all! You always give me really valuable feedback, so I hope you'll come back more often!": "",
  "Definitely. After all... this place takes the cake.": "",
  "You think so? Well, I'd hate to see you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>dessert</font_kind> us... So please come back again soon!": "",
  "(Sakuma-san really seems to value my input. Makes me want to talk cakes with her more often.)": "",
  "Thank you for visiting us today.": "",
  "Ah, Sakuma-san. Hello there.": "",
  "Hello and welcome. Can I ask for your thoughts about today's cake as well?": "",
  "Hey, Sakuma-san. I've got an aching for some baking.": "",
  "Well you're in for a treat, 'cause I just put the finishing touches on a special new dessert!": "",
  "And what would that be?": "",
  "It is... the one and only... Mega Fruit Tart!": "",
  "Not just any fruit tart, but a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>mega</font_kind> fruit tart? I like it.": "",
  "Yep. We start by using a heaping helping of only the freshest fruits available, so it looks and tastes terrific.": "",
  "And then we finish it off with a sumptuous helping of sweet but slightly tart custard. Is your mouth watering yet?": "",
  "Oh yeah. I can feel my sweet tooth tingling in its nerve ending as we speak.": "",
  "Hehe. If it wasn't for all your constructive criticism, I doubt I could've created such a masterpiece. So thank you!": "",
  "Nah, all I did was eat. You put in all the hard work.": "",
  "Well I hope you enjoy the fruits of our labor. The mega fruit tarts, that is!": "",
  "I think I've said my piece on just about every cake you got.": "",
  "You've given me plenty of food for thought, that's for sure. I really can't thank you enough.": "",
  "No problem. Can't wait to see what you whip up next.": "",
  "Is this Yagami? From Yagami Detective Agency?": "",
  "Speaking. What can I do for you?": "",
  "I'm calling to talk about a request I submitted. Should be under the name Yosuke Saotome?": "",
  "Right, Saotome-san. Why don't we meet at my office so we can go over the details?": "",
  "Works for me. I'll drop in!": "",
  "And yes, I'm Yosuke Saotome.": "",
  "Oh, and this is my sister, Tsukino.": "",
  "Hello.": "",
  "(Guess they're twins or something.)": "",
  "Well, shall we get down to business? What can I help you with?": "",
  "Before that, Yagami-san... I have a question for you. Have you ever heard of the Twisted Trio?": "",
  "Um... No? Should I have?": "",
  "Well, yes! They're a gang of perverts who have been terrorizing Kamurocho!": "",
  "Stealing underwear, public groping, peeping on unsuspecting couples... These guys are shameless.": "",
  "Oh. First I'm hearing about them...": "",
  "Now you know. They're three really bad guys, and they have names to prove it. Our problem is with the Panty Professor.": "",
  "The... Panty Professor? Did I hear that right?": "",
  "I'm afraid so. His obsession with women's underwear is how he earned that one.": "",
  "Which brings us to my request. A few days ago, my sister fell victim to this... Panty Professor.": "",
  "Yagami-san, you have to bring this wretch to justice!": "",
  "Please, detective. I can't even relax in my own bedroom anymore.": "",
  "Well, I'll need a little more info first. And I'm sorry if this is uncomfortable to discuss, but...": "",
  "It's fine... But, um, every time I hang my panties out to dry on the balcony, they get stolen.": "",
  "It never fails, especially with my panties that have a certain style.": "",
  "The guy must be particular about his fetish.": "",
  "Have you managed to catch a glimpse of the culprit?": "",
  "Well, not exactly... He actually steals them with a drone.": "",
  "A drone?": "",
  "Yup. That's his M.O. You could even say it's his calling card.": "",
  "Ah, so that's how you came to suspect you were a victim of the Panty Professor himself.": "",
  "And have you gone to the police with this?": "",
  "Of course we have, but even with all their resources, they're struggling to tighten the noose on this guy.": "",
  "His drone is pretty fast, too...": "",
  "Then it sounds like we'll need to set up a trap to catch him...": "",
  "Then you plan on taking the case? I offered 50,000 yen for the job...": "",
  "Yes. That's fine, but you're a student right? Can you afford that?": "",
  "Oh, don't worry about me! But how will you catch him?": "",
  "I think we'll have to draw him out... with panties.": "",
  "That's a good plan, but... Then we'd need to know what his preferences are...": "",
  "(She needs to spill it. This is about to get awkward.)": "",
  "Tsukino-san. If you want my help, you'll need to divulge what kind of panties you wear.": "",
  "It's how it has to be. Are they white? Black? Thongs?": "",
  "He's right, the more details you can give me, the better our chances.": "",
  "Aah! You really need a lot of details, huh?": "",
  "Do you want to catch this guy or not, Tsukino? He wouldn't ask unless he needed that information.": "",
  "He's right. Trust me, this is purely professional. I don't have any personal stake in this.": "",
  "(I can't ask her about her panties with her brother here...)": "",
  "I see you're struggling with what comes next, Yagami-san. Allow me.": "",
  "(He's going to do it, isn't he...)": "",
  "Tsukino. Tell our detective friend here what kind of panties you wear.": "",
  "What!? Do we really need to go that far!?": "",
  "Sorry, but he's right. I can't catch this guy if I don't have the right bait.": "",
  "U-Um... There's a pattern, I guess...": "",
  "And that is?": "",
  "They're lace. Mostly black, but I have a few red pairs too. Some have little ribbons on the front.": "",
  "That should be enough. Thanks for your bravery, Tsukino.": "",
  "Urgh...": "",
  "(Well, that could have gone worse.)": "",
  "Okay, I'll find some panties just like that and I'll set the trap.": "",
  "If this Panty Professor guy is really out there, that should lure him out.": "",
  "But even it if does, how would you catch him? That's why he uses the drone!": "",
  "The drone has to go somewhere. If I put a GPS tracker on the panties, I'll know exactly where.": "",
  "Huh... That's pretty clever, actually.": "",
  "I'm looking forward to your results, Yagami-san. Thank you so much. Help us get this pervert off the streets!": "",
  "(...Guess I should head over to Le Marche and buy some panties. Good times.)": "",
  "Would you like these gift-wrapped, sir?": "",
  "No thanks, I have a more immediate need for these.": "",
  "An... immediate need, sir?": "",
  "Very well, sir. Discretion is our guarantee.": "",
  "Wait, what!? N-No, they're not for me!": "",
  "Of course not, sir. To each their own.": "",
  "(I'm really on a roll today...)": "",
  "(Okay, once I have a tracker on these, I just need to take them up to the roof.)": "",
  "I guess this should do it.": "",
  "I wonder how obvious this is, though? He might see right through it...": "",
  "Oh well. Still worth a shot.": "",
  "(Here comes a drone!)": "",
  "(Yes, he took the bait!)": "",
  "(Now I just follow the signal of our intrepid panty thief to the source. The batting cages...)": "",
  "*sniff* *sniff* *sniff* Ah, the fragrance is fresh, but there are notes of musk...": "",
  "Perhaps this is a nice and burly, working woman type...": "",
  "Hey, you.": "",
  "Hm? Who dares to disturb my feast!?": "",
  "You the one they call the Panty Professor?": "",
  "Indeed I am. I have a great many names. Panty Professor, Skivvies Scholar, Lingerie Literati...": "",
  "Perhaps you've come to partake of the banquet with me? Or are you just a scavenger, hoping for sloppy seconds?": "",
  "Not to ruin the moment, but those are actually mine. Well... not <font_kind=yakuza_italic>mine</font_kind>, per se. I bought them to lure you out.": "",
  "What!? I don't deserve this punishment...": "",
  "Blecchhh! I'm gonna puke! I've been basking in the scent of <font_kind=yakuza_italic>man</font_kind> sweat!?": "",
  "Just come along quietly, man. We'll find you some real strong odors down at the station.": "",
  "Never! There are far too many panties in the world just waiting for me to discover them!": "",
  "If you're going to interfere, then this is where you die!": "",
  "(Damn! He's going for a gun...)": "",
  "Wait, whose are those!?": "",
  "These belonged to none other than the heartthrob supermodel, Arisa Takeda!": "",
  "*sniff* *sniff* *sniff*... *sniff* *sniff* *sniff*... ": "",
  "Yes, yes, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>yes</font_kind>! Their fuchsia power is welling up within me!": "",
  "Hrahhh!": "",
  "What!? Is he actually getting stronger!?": "",
  "The scent of eros grants me strength! Prepare yourself for the might of my swelling libido!": "",
  "How!? Even my panty-fueled rage couldn't cut the mustard...": "",
  "Hey! You're coming downtown, sicko!": "",
  "I may have fallen limp... but the others still stand erect! They shall ensure you meet your end!": "",
  "Hahaha... Hahahahaha! See you in hell!": "",
  "That's enough outta you! Come on!": "",
  "(I should tell the Saotome twins what happened.)": "",
  "You can rest easy now. The Panty Professor's going away for a long time.": "",
  "Wow! You're amazing, Yagami-san! You actually caught him!": "",
  "Thank you, Yagami-san. Now I can sleep in peace.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "That's true.": "ก็จริงนะ",
  "And what would that be?": "แล้วนั่นคืออะไรล่ะ?",
  "Hello.": "สวัสดี",
  "A drone?": "โดรนเหรอ?",
  "And that is?": "แล้วมันคืออะไรล่ะ?",
  "Urgh...": "อุก...",
  "Hey, you.": "นี่ เธอ"
 }
}
